    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: 45b88dc2b250271422db1e3c547eecb3ad5514d5 -->\n**Ready for the maintainer to merge.**\n\nWhat looks good\n- Deletes only `ci.yml` and `nightly.yml`; `release.yml` and `aur-package.yml` are untouched (the maintainer asked for the removal in #1415).\n- Grep of the PR head tree: no live reference to the deleted files. Remaining hits are the AGENTS.md line recording the removal, the decision file, `release.yml`'s own `workflow_dispatch`, and an unrelated \"nightly\" invalid-tier parse test in `xtask/src/tests.rs`.\n- AGENTS.md \"GitHub Actions minutes are budgeted\" stays true (only `release.yml` on a tag; no push/PR/schedule trigger added).\n- `PROCESS_VERSION` 54 -> 55; decision file present; body has `Changelog: none` and `Fixes #1415`.\n\nLocal results\n- Docs/process only, nothing built (no Rust or build files touched). Trial merge with current main (post v0.19.0): clean, no conflicts.\n\nRequested before merge\n- None.\n\nNotes (not blocking)\n- #1425 also bumps to 55; whichever merges second takes 56.\n- Minor: the new AGENTS.md sentence at line ~766 is a long line; reflow if convenient.\n\nA maintainer will approve and merge by hand.\n",
